# The runtime libraries: what a script in the Python runtime can import, beyond the
# standard library. Each one is pinned with its hashes in requirements.txt, resolved
# from PyPI alone. After changing this list, run `make runtime-lock`, then update the
# library's entry in `src/maji_mcp/common/runtime_libraries.py`, which agents read and
# a test checks against the lock.
#
GitPython
PyYAML
Jinja2
markdown-it-py
Pygments
tree-sitter
tree-sitter-javascript
tree-sitter-typescript
tree-sitter-go
tree-sitter-rust
tree-sitter-ruby
tree-sitter-perl
unidiff
pathspec
RapidFuzz
duckdb
pandas
